{"lines":[{"w":0.036893202463785815,"y":0.088662790789739931,"x":0.0718446608123358,"t":"MAN:","h":0.011627906728013615,"c":1},{"x":0.073731891104948349,"y":0.1204625629481646,"w":0.058361460367838541,"c":1,"h":0.010528362428659177,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"y":0.15406976715253684,"h":0.010174419129748924,"t":"MAN.","w":0.038834950129191081,"x":0.069902913192941507,"c":1},{"w":0.05839470545450845,"h":0.010638682047526049,"x":0.073715269346317697,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.16837251927747066},{"x":0.069902913198619132,"w":0.038834950129191095,"h":0.011627906728013615,"c":1,"y":0.23401162799904229,"t":"MAN:"},{"y":0.2484707609295228,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.060259462992350257,"h":0.014686384824948884,"c":1,"x":0.069870268910936298},{"x":0.0718446608123358,"y":0.2834302324786413,"w":0.036893202463785815,"h":0.00872093034310506,"c":1,"t":"MAN:"},{"c":1,"y":0.29782551891172582,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.060301907857259113,"h":0.013360589761229003,"x":0.069849046582424135},{"h":0.011627906728013726,"w":0.038834950129191081,"c":1,"y":0.34738372102039805,"x":0.069902913193542679,"t":"MAN:"},{"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.069719988217560716,"y":0.37460749729390641,"w":0.060560022989908854,"h":0.016773377177871307,"c":1},{"t":"MAN:","y":0.42877906947663069,"w":0.036893202463785815,"x":0.0718446608123358,"h":0.010174419129749035,"c":1},{"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.011627906728013615,"x":0.069902912681824303,"y":0.44476744196545059,"w":0.060194174448649107,"c":1},{"h":0.011627906728013726,"c":1,"x":0.069902913368136782,"t":"MAN:","w":0.038834950129191081,"y":0.47674418608782043},{"w":0.060240319569905609,"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.011761844195309457,"y":0.49266558945722694,"c":1,"x":0.069879840372524787},{"t":"OK. And what about the salary? In my last job I was getting £9.50 per hour. I was","w":0.64088963826497392,"y":0.085692226152569329,"h":0.018077978686751539,"x":0.16887115772159442,"c":1},{"h":0.014641744548286595,"c":1,"x":0.16893204342836365,"y":0.10311526477834576,"w":0.26990290323893229,"t":"hoping to get a bit more than that."},{"x":0.16893203008544191,"t":"Well, to begin with, you'd be getting £9.75 but that goes up to £11.25 after three","y":0.11918604660559984,"h":0.016016445575844807,"c":1,"w":0.62912623087565112},{"x":0.16893202663947149,"w":0.44077672322591155,"t":"That's not too bad. And I suppose it's a very early start?","y":0.15109034244066255,"h":0.016199376947040545,"c":1},{"h":0.016199376947040434,"t":"Mmm. That's the only unattractive thing about this job. But then you have the","x":0.16893203699881146,"y":0.16853582568051007,"w":0.60582524617513023,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.61165049235026048,"t":"afternoons and evenings free. So the restaurant starts serving breakfast from","h":0.016030029344410224,"y":0.18459302334983252,"x":0.16699028770573202},{"y":0.20058139544284659,"w":0.59805826822916663,"c":1,"x":0.1689320308322497,"h":0.015988371899566256,"t":"7 a.m. And you'd have to be there at 5.30 to set everything up. But you'd be"},{"t":"finished at 12.30.","y":0.2165109031537098,"x":0.16699028936935204,"h":0.014641744548286706,"w":0.14174757639567057,"c":1},{"x":0.1669902969668873,"h":0.014534884301301565,"c":1,"y":0.23255813924131785,"t":"Mmm. Well, as you say, there are advantages to that.","w":0.42330095926920575},{"w":0.63883494059244794,"h":0.015988371899566145,"c":1,"x":0.16699029654360487,"t":"Now, you might also be interested in the job at the City Road branch. That's for a","y":0.24854651172084674},{"y":0.26448598141063084,"w":0.37864077250162764,"x":0.16504854567374119,"c":1,"t":"junior chef, so again a position of responsibility.","h":0.016037274298266846},{"w":0.21814539591471355,"y":0.27929964158466669,"h":0.018231665828146282,"x":0.16665784723222488,"c":1,"t":"I might prefer that, actually."},{"x":0.16886776369607379,"t":"Right, well obviously this role would involve supporting the sous chef and other","h":0.017518802892381946,"w":0.62341659545898431,"y":0.29648276667075646,"c":1},{"w":0.6407767232259115,"y":0.31246105907520927,"h":0.017480801496178922,"x":0.16699027904571551,"t":"senior staff. And you'd be responsible for making sure there's enough stock each","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.32891439447685344,"x":0.16690359419073539,"w":0.32252405802408857,"t":"week - and sorting out all the deliveries.","h":0.015627093329979247},{"h":0.017577700748621972,"t":"Ive never done that before, but I imagine it's fairly straightforward, once you get","y":0.34579439238190224,"w":0.63300969441731769,"c":1,"x":0.16699029830342235},{"h":0.014023749330704827,"t":"the hang of it.","y":0.36144742764150006,"x":0.16883396031130024,"w":0.10893402099609376,"c":1},{"x":0.16692870337420146,"t":"Yes, and you'd be working alongside more experienced staff to begin with, so","w":0.61176986694335933,"h":0.018273791494399227,"y":0.377167438230672,"c":1},{"w":0.63703414916992185,"x":0.16691256307540073,"t":"I'm sure it wouldn't be a problem. The salary's slightly higher here. It's an annual","h":0.017605273523063292,"c":1,"y":0.39365918621812079},{"y":0.41121495309271672,"c":1,"t":"salary of £23,000.","h":0.016199376947040545,"w":0.14757280985514326,"x":0.16699029401053517},{"x":0.16504855585365721,"t":"Iknow that if they like you, it's likely you'll be promoted quite quickly. So that's","h":0.016000144578214748,"y":0.4433021809017218,"c":1,"w":0.61553395589192716},{"h":0.014647177818036927,"w":0.16504854838053384,"c":1,"x":0.16699028883747236,"t":"worth thinking about.","y":0.45919003116990265},{"t":"Yes. It does sound interesting. What are the hours like?","y":0.47529069776759414,"x":0.16699029659654846,"w":0.43883494059244793,"h":0.015988371899566145,"c":1},{"t":"The usual, I think. There's a lot of evening and weekend work, but they're closed","y":0.49273255823381124,"x":0.16699028079469988,"w":0.63495147705078125,"h":0.015990182989482959,"c":1},{"x":0.1669206584661769,"y":0.50717886403923351,"w":0.63703191121419278,"c":1,"h":0.017719458939501775,"t":"on Mondays. But you do get one Sunday off every four weeks. So would you like"},{"t":"me to send off your ...","x":0.16854476134050458,"w":0.17760073343912761,"c":1,"y":0.52040368629069655,"h":0.018837273380838071},{"w":0.10114851633707683,"t":"PART 2","c":1,"y":0.57380902730180605,"x":0.071755838236997938,"h":0.016626131051797333},{"x":0.071791792594156426,"w":0.72047617594401037,"h":0.016207865539740962,"y":0.60458530885391792,"c":1,"t":"Hello everyone. It's good to see that so many members of the public have shown up for our"},{"c":1,"t":"presentation on the new housing development planned on the outskirts of Nunston. I'm Mark","w":0.73024744669596353,"x":0.069833119539354699,"y":0.62013163360560897,"h":0.018246028579284146},{"y":0.63709307274547233,"w":0.51472274780273441,"h":0.017157540960103912,"t":"Reynolds and I'm Communications Manager at the development.","x":0.069825498822177257,"c":1},{"y":0.66075882055853508,"h":0.018222910444313123,"w":0.73798294067382808,"c":1,"x":0.067902602163189177,"t":"I'll start by giving you a brief overview of our plans for the development. So one thing I'm sure"},{"c":1,"y":0.67877906947490418,"t":"you'll want to know is why we've selected this particular site for a housing development. At","h":0.014678874268338693,"x":0.067961155806509382,"w":0.71650487263997398},{"x":0.069902914754250534,"y":0.6947040500633781,"w":0.70679611206054682,"h":0.013144787226881949,"c":1,"t":"present it's being used for farming, like much of the land around Nunston. But because of"},{"h":0.020667056502582937,"c":1,"t":"the new industrial centre in Nunston, there's a lot of demand for housing for employees in","x":0.06782786143840501,"y":0.70824716986508318,"w":0.70898101806640623},{"t":"the region, as many employees are having to commute long distances at present. Of course,","x":0.067849509781652551,"y":0.72479980816614642,"w":0.73422093709309899,"h":0.019435274118203671,"c":1},{"w":0.69902913411458323,"x":0.067961160980366392,"y":0.7426791275158896,"h":0.016041802617248413,"t":"there's also the fact that we have an international airport just 20 minutes' drive away, but","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"although that's certainly convenient, it wasn't one of our major criteria for choosing the site.","x":0.067961171545930857,"y":0.7585669781754284,"w":0.72038833618164066,"h":0.016199376947040545},{"c":1,"w":0.73805348714192709,"x":0.069808092714335621,"y":0.77322040732845543,"h":0.017548124366831508,"t":"We were more interested in the fact that there's an excellent hospital just 15 kilometres away."},{"x":0.06791358898980103,"t":"and a large secondary school even closer than that. One drawback to the site is that it's","y":0.7905672043367119,"w":0.69330561319986972,"h":0.016109827820014355,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.018923065446990295,"y":0.80580568812156206,"t":"on quite a steep slope, but we've taken account of that in our planning so it shouldn't be a","w":0.71082478841145835,"x":0.067889462501424441},{"y":0.82270588545993195,"x":0.067691063858663317,"c":1,"t":"major problem.","w":0.12488642374674479,"h":0.016104553793078291},{"h":0.019423443803163298,"y":0.84560007899972844,"c":1,"x":0.067834938993975885,"w":0.66237497965494796,"t":"We've had a lot of positive feedback about the plans. People like the wide variety of"},{"t":"accommodation types and prices, and the fact that it's only a short drive to get out into the","c":1,"w":0.71067962646484373,"y":0.86479750781120435,"h":0.016016445575844807,"x":0.067961157482900061},{"y":0.88003643266528886,"w":0.71661493937174481,"c":1,"t":"countryside from the development. We were particularly pleased that so many people liked","h":0.017060616751697566,"x":0.067907238967123168},{"t":"Test 2","y":0.039244186324560504,"c":1,"h":0.014649894452911982,"x":0.8446601957751485,"w":0.062135918935139922},{"t":"Q8","x":0.83495145703095641,"h":0.015988371899566145,"c":1,"w":0.029126211802164681,"y":0.11773255807637972},{"w":0.027184464136759456,"t":"Q9","x":0.83300970975686295,"y":0.3299418606237714,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"c":1,"t":"Q10","x":0.83300970935669927,"h":0.01308139551465759,"y":0.50872093010876862},{"t":"Q11\/12","w":0.060194174448649052,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"x":0.83300970879832925,"y":0.71220930222086887},{"w":0.062392628987630205,"y":0.77581423065217969,"x":0.83093960774210052,"h":0.01377851539683117,"t":"Q11\/12","c":1},{"h":0.01308139551465759,"y":0.95639534871796172,"w":0.040776697794596362,"t":"105","x":0.86213592284488094,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3209}